      "describe_ch": "系統洞察力：培養學生整合多維度視角，分析臺灣水資源挑戰系統性成因與價值衝突，並學習運用敘事設計與數位傳播技巧，將複雜議題轉譯為引發公眾共鳴的溝通內容。",
      "describe_en": "Systemic Insight: To cultivate students' ability to integrate multidimensional perspectives in analyzing the systemic causes and value conflicts inherent in Taiwan’s water resource challenges. Furthermore, to equip them with narrative design and digital communication skills that enable them to translate complex issues into resonant content engaging the public.",
