      "core_item": "知識探索：能培養多元領域學習的興趣；能統整跨領域的知識；能持續從事跨領域的學習。",
      "core_eng": "Knowledge Pursuit：To integrate extensive interests, curiosities and literacy of multidisciplinary knowledge and internalize one’s won viewpoints.",
